title: TUR Courses
subtitle: One course of the workers’ university, one click; the game picks whom it serves.
new-page: true
is-card: true
tags: party_affairs
view-if: {! return !!Q.S && !!Q.polish_party_rules && PolishParty.turCardAvailable(Q) !}
on-arrival: {!
// Card party.tur_courses (Z — 0.78, decision 5A of 8 X 2026): the courses of TUR left the party agenda for a card of their own,
// in the Party deck once TUR works. Each course is one click: this month's action and 1 R, two months of work, one course at a
// time and then four months before the next (13.2); the target is chosen by PolishParty.courseTarget.
PolishParty.turCardView(Q);
!}

= TUR courses

TUR: [+ pl_party_tur +]. Party money: [+ pl_party_cash +]. A course costs this month's action and 1 resource and gives its result after two months.

- @civil_rights
- @union_cadres
- @social_reform
- @national_education
- @easy_discard

@civil_rights
title: Civil rights and the practice of democracy (level 1)
subtitle: [+ pl_tur_civil_rights_target +] Radicalisation falls (−3), and their next democracy campaign within six months works better (+0.10, once).
choose-if: {! return PolishParty.courseStatus(Q, 'civil_rights', PolishParty.courseTarget(Q, 'civil_rights')).available !}
unavailable-subtitle: [+ pl_tur_civil_rights_why +]
on-arrival: {!
PolishParty.turCardCourse(Q, 'civil_rights');
!}
go-to: result

@union_cadres
title: Union cadres and the line of PPS (level 2)
subtitle: [+ pl_tur_union_cadres_target +] Trust rises (+3) and dissent falls (−4); it does not order the union to follow another line.
choose-if: {! return PolishParty.courseStatus(Q, 'union_cadres', PolishParty.courseTarget(Q, 'union_cadres')).available !}
unavailable-subtitle: [+ pl_tur_union_cadres_why +]
on-arrival: {!
PolishParty.turCardCourse(Q, 'union_cadres');
!}
go-to: result

@social_reform
title: Preparation of a social reform (level 2)
subtitle: [+ pl_tur_social_reform_target +] A large labour, education, housing or cooperative project not yet launched: full preparation and one month shorter, once.
choose-if: {! return PolishParty.courseStatus(Q, 'social_reform').available !}
unavailable-subtitle: [+ pl_tur_social_reform_why +]
on-arrival: {!
PolishParty.turCardCourse(Q, 'social_reform');
!}
go-to: result

@national_education
title: A national education campaign (level 3)
subtitle: [+ pl_tur_national_education_target +] As the civil rights course, in three classes at once.
choose-if: {! return PolishParty.courseStatus(Q, 'national_education', PolishParty.courseTarget(Q, 'national_education')).available !}
unavailable-subtitle: [+ pl_tur_national_education_why +]
on-arrival: {!
PolishParty.turCardCourse(Q, 'national_education');
!}
go-to: result

@result
new-page: true

= TUR courses

